{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "明天之前答复  (One Day Left to Decide on DTS)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "fang": "方老师"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the Xingtian pantry, Bu Xiaogu gets a phone call from her advisor Professor Fang about her thesis deadline and the prestigious DTS job offer. Listen to their call first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，方老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，论文期限快到了，你知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你真的想放弃去电视台工作的机会吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，我还在想。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，人生大事一定要慎重。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "不过你还得尽快回复我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "这样吧，明天之前给我一个最终答复。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，我知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢您，方老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "老师再见。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，方老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Professor Fang.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，论文期限快到了，你知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, the thesis deadline is almost here, do you know?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你真的想放弃去电视台工作的机会吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you really want to give up the chance to work at the TV network?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，我还在想。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Professor Fang, I am still thinking.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，人生大事一定要慎重。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, major life decisions must be made carefully.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "不过你还得尽快回复我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'However, you still have to reply to me as soon as possible.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "这样吧，明天之前给我一个最终答复。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How about this, give me a final answer before tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，我知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, I understand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢您，方老师。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, Professor Fang.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "老师再见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Goodbye, Professor.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，方老师。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，论文期限快到了，你知道吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你真的想放弃去电视台工作的机会吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，我还在想。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，人生大事一定要慎重。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "不过你还得尽快回复我。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "这样吧，明天之前给我一个最终答复。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，我知道了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢您，方老师。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "老师再见。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Professor Fang gives Xiaogu until tomorrow to choose between DTS and staying at Xingtian. You learned how to answer the phone with \"wei\", say a deadline is close with \"kuai dao le\", and thank an elder politely with \"xiexie nin\". See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
